{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/Steam_title__2_.gif?t=1744364687\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Corner Shop: Nightshift is a narrative-driven shop simulator with psychological horror elements. Your job isn\u2019t just about keeping shelves stocked \u2014 it\u2019s about keeping yourself together. Each shift, you\u2019ll manage inventory, handle deliveries, serve customers, and maintain the store, but exhaustion, stress, and paranoia are just as important as your till balance. The more tired you get, the more reality distorts \u2014 your reaction time slows, shadows shift, and security footage contradicts what you remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/Steam_simulator__1_.gif?t=1744364687\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Restock shelves, mop the floor, fix the damn lights. Take deliveries, scan items, and serve customers. Done? Good, now upgrade the store: new alarms, working cameras, stronger locks. Manage your time. Manage your money. Manage your mental state. No one\u2019s coming to help and meds don\u2019t pay for themselves. Try not to lose your job\u2026 or your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3306990/extras/Steam_horror.gif?t=1744364687\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You lost your wife. You\u2019re trying to get your daughter back. The night shift won\u2019t let you forget that. Odd events rip you out of routine: power cuts, sudden alarms, freaks in the aisles. You need to solve the puzzles. What happened? What\u2019s real? What\u2019s next? Keep your stress down. Keep breathing. Don\u2019t let the paranoia finish the job.   <br>Scared? Take your meds. Better, right? </